In the fixed window algorithm requests are set per time frame
e.g 2000 requests per hour
100 requests per minute

PROS
Easy to implemnt and works quite well for apps where you have specific quotas for each endpoint

CONS
As the available quota resets, they are subject to spikes at the edges of the window

which means you can make 2000 requests near the last 1 minute of the hour and when tthe hour expires you make another 2000 which resulsts in spike
